612: /**
613:  * Phase 79: Plane-Based Grid with Adaptive Spacing/Subdivisions
614:  * 
615:  * Grid uses the active projection plane's intrinsic (u,v) coordinate system
616:  * Transformation pipeline: Plane (u,v) → Paper (x,y) → Screen (pixels)
617:  * 
618:  * Major Grid Lines (Powers of 10):
619:  * - Major lines always at multiples of 10^n (e.g., 0.1, 1, 10, 100, 1000)
620:  * - Power of 10 chosen based on zoom level to keep reasonable density
